{
  "_comment": "Instrument universe for the arbitrage scanner. Edit freely; the daily scan re-reads this file.",

  "equivalent_pairs": {
    "_comment": "Two listings with (nearly) identical economic claims. 'ratio' = shares of b per share of a when the claims are identical (e.g. 1 BRK-A = 1500 BRK-B). The scanner trades deviations of price(a)/(ratio*price(b)) from its own trailing mean.",
